  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Communication on the Peace and Stabilisation Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to plan, prepare and produce a repository of stories and results from the Peace and Stabilisation Fund, which promotes peace and stability in fragile and conflict-affected regions. This includes effectively communicating the concrete results, success stories and lessons learned emerging from the Peace and Stabilisation Fund through newsletters, SoMe and press material, as well as mapping policy opportunities on a quarterly basis, to share with relevant stakeholders including, decision-makers and the Danish Parliament, development practitioners, the security sector and the broader public.</narrative>
  </description>
